    "https://wvu.taleo.net/careersection/faculty/jobsearch.ftl?lang=en&portal=26100021550": {
      "title": "Welcome. You are not signed in.",
      "description": "Job Search Careers | West Virginia University Skip to main content Careers Talent and Culture Required Postings WVU Home Home Career Opportunities Why WVU Community Information WVU Talent Network Welcome. You are not signed in. Sign In Job Search My Jobpage This service is set to disconnect automatically after 60 minutes of inactivity. Your session will end in 20 minutes. Click OK to reset the timer to 60 minutes. OK You have been signed out. This service is set to sign out after 60 minutes of inactivity. OK Search Tips You can search jobs by entering relevant data in the above search fields and by filtering the job list with additional criteria. Saving searches You can save the current search by clicking \"Save this Search\". Searches are saved in the \"My Saved Searches\" section, under the \"My Jobpage\" tab. Advanced Job Search To perform a job search using advanced search criteria, click the \"Advanced Search\" link on the search bar and select relevant criteria. Candidate Profile Take a few minutes to create or modify your employment profile and to specify your preferred working criteria for future openings matching your interests. Access my profile Icon legend Urgent need job Added to the job cart Draft submission Completed submission Keyword Location View All Jobs Advanced Search Advanced Job Search × Organization Add Organization Location Add Location Job Field Add Job Field Job Number Urgent Jobs Urgent Jobs Only Study Level None High School Diploma/GED (±11 years) Technical Diploma (±12 years) Associate's Degree/College Diploma (±13 years) Non-Degree Program (±14 years) Bachelor's Degree (±16 years) Master's Degree (±18 years) Doctorate Degree (over 19 years) Other Job Shift Day Job Evening Job Night Job On Call Variable Weekend Job Openings Job Openings RSS: Cancel Add Selection limit reached OK Clear Save this Search Job list in single line view. Press ENTER to switch to multi line view. Single-line Sort by Job Title Schedule Location Relevancy Unposting Date Posting Date Order Ascending Descending Save this search so you do not have to select search criteria the next time you are looking for similar jobs. Search Name Save this Search Cancel Access My Saved Searches You are about to override a search query and all of its content. Are you sure that you want to override it? Confirm Cancel You cannot save this search because you have reached the maximum number of saved searches allowed. Please delete or override an existing search query. OK You must specify a search query name. OK OK Icons Requisition Title Location Posting Date Actions No jobs correspond to the specified criteria. To improve your search results, remove one or more filters. You can also view all available job openings. Previous Next You cannot add this item to the job cart, because you have already reached the maximum number of items allowed in the job cart (25). You must first delete an existing item to be able to add a new one. OK Contact us SHARED SERVICES CUSTOMER CARE Location : 3rd Floor, One Waterfront Place, Morgantown, WV 26501 Phone : (304)-293-6006 Email : sharedservices@mail.wvu.edu Get directions to our office Hours Of Operation Monday - Friday Support by Phone Call: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Support by Online Chat: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Excluding University holidays Accreditations Web Standards Questions or Comments? © 2025 West Virginia University. West Virginia University is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Last updated on March 6, 2025. A-Z Site Index Campus Map Jobs Directory Give MyAccess MountaineerTRAK WVU Alert WVU Today WVU Portal WVU on Facebook WVU on Twitter WVU on YouTube"
